From bd868010ab2234b646a6657d38da517a5ad3ddec Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Suresh, Prashanth" <prashanth.suresh@intel.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 07:55:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] libvpl: Fix stale version-script path in Android.bp

The linker version-script cflag pointed at
vendor/intel/external/onevpl/dispatcher/linux/libvpl.map, a path that
predates upstream's "Rename dispatcher directory to libvpl" commit --
this file did not exist even in our pre-upgrade HEAD, a pre-existing
latent bug this version bump happened to surface while reconciling
the glue. The real file lives at
vendor/intel/external/onevpl/libvpl/src/linux/libvpl.map; update the
reference accordingly.

Tracked-On: NIACP3-1547
Signed-off-by: Suresh, Prashanth <prashanth.suresh@intel.com>
---
 libvpl/Android.bp | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/libvpl/Android.bp b/libvpl/Android.bp
index 79434aa..4d91c33 100644
--- a/libvpl/Android.bp
+++ b/libvpl/Android.bp
@@ -50,7 +50,7 @@ cc_library_shared {
         "-Wno-missing-braces",
         "-Wno-unused-parameter",
         "-Wno-missing-field-initializers",
-        "-Wl,--version-script=vendor/intel/external/onevpl/dispatcher/linux/libvpl.map",
+        "-Wl,--version-script=vendor/intel/external/onevpl/libvpl/src/linux/libvpl.map",
     ],
 
     arch: {
-- 
2.34.1

